# livvo-landing

  Landing page for [Livvo](https://livvo.tech) — AI for real estate agencies that automates lead handling, qualification, and scheduling over WhatsApp.

  🌐 **Live:** https://livvo.tech

  ## What is Livvo

  Livvo responds to, pre-qualifies, and books real estate leads on WhatsApp 24/7, integrating with the tools agencies already use. Built for mid-size real
  estate agencies in Colombia.

  - 24/7 intelligent assistant
  - Personalized property recommendations
  - Automatic appointment reminders
  - Built-in CRM and dashboard
  - Integrations with Finca Raíz and Metrocuadrado

  ## Stack

  Static single-file HTML. No build step, no dependencies.

  ## Local development

  ```bash
  # Open the file directly
  open index.html

  # Or serve with any static server
  npx serve .

  Deploy

  Hosted on Vercel (https://vercel.com). Every push to main deploys automatically to https://livvo.tech.

  Contact

  Want a demo? → Book it at livvo.tech (https://livvo.tech)

